### Koffy API - Coffee Variants Endpoints
### Coffee variants are scoped within roasters and coffees
### Make sure to replace {{token}} with your actual JWT token

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@roasterId = 1
@coffeeId = 1

### 1. Create a coffee variant - Whole Bean, 250g
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee_variant": {
    "grind_type": "whole_bean",
    "bag_size": "250g",
    "price": 12.99,
    "stock": 50
  }
}

