###
### Coffee Variant Fields:
### - grind_type: String (required) - Type of grind
###   Options: whole_bean, espresso, filter, french_press, cold_brew, turkish, etc.
### - bag_size: String (required) - Size of the bag
###   Common sizes: 100g, 250g, 500g, 1kg
### - price: Decimal (required) - Price for this specific variant
### - stock: Integer (required) - Initial stock quantity
###

### Grind Types Reference:
### - whole_bean: Granos enteros (sin moler)
### - espresso: Molido fino para máquinas de espresso
### - filter: Molido medio para cafeteras de filtro y pour-over
### - french_press: Molido grueso para prensa francesa
### - cold_brew: Molido extra grueso para preparación en frío
### - turkish: Molido extra fino para café turco
### - medium: Molido medio universal
### - coarse: Molido grueso

### Common Bag Sizes:
### - 100g: Sample/Tasting size
### - 250g: Standard home use
### - 500g: Medium size for regular consumers
### - 1kg: Bulk size for heavy users or commercial

### Permission Requirements:
### Action                | Public | Member | Barista | Manager | Owner
### ---------------------|--------|--------|---------|---------|-------
### Create variant       |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
###
### Note: Only create is available for variants through this endpoint
### Other operations (view, update, delete, stock management) require
### direct access to the variant resource if implemented in the future

### Important:
### - Variants must belong to a coffee that belongs to the specified roaster
### - You must have edit privileges (barista, manager, or owner) on the roaster
### - Each variant is unique by the combination of coffee_id, grind_type, and bag_size
### - Price can vary between different variants of the same coffee

